phrase: count matching items between bounds {lo} across {hi}
test: list=5,12,18,25,30 lo=10 hi=20
expect: => i=2 r=0.0 ok=true s="items within range count: 2" errors=0 n=5 res=[5,12,18,25,30] cache=0 hits=0
