phrase: dedupe numbers while saving to cache if {p}
phrase: remove duplicate values caching items satisfying {p}
test: list=2,3,2,4,4 p=is_even
expect: => i=3 r=0.0 ok=true s="deduped to 3 items" errors=0 n=3 res=[2,3,4] cache=2 hits=0
